do Global.cam_switch_to_static(6)
do Global.stop_movement()
[wait time="1.0"]
set {npc_name1} = "Guard 1"
set {npc_name2} = "Guard 2"
Townsfolk: ...
Townsfolk: Hey.
Townsfolk2: Yeah...?
Townsfolk: You ever wonder why we're here?
Townsfolk2: It's one of life's great mysteries isn't it?
Townsfolk2: Why are we here? I mean, are we just some numbers and mathematical operations within a computer, or do we possess a will of our own, even if generated by a creator?
Townsfolk2: I don't know, man, but it keeps me up at night.
[wait time="1.0"]
Townsfolk: What?
Townsfolk: I mean why are we out here, on guard duty.
do Global.cam_switch_to_static(7)
Townsfolk: If all there is in the rest of the world is some poorly placed pasture and the end of the square.
Townsfolk: No one to defend ourselves against, nothing to guard, no threat.
Townsfolk: And despite this, we have walls, and we’re the ones who suck it up and guard them.
[wait time="1.0"]
Townsfolk2: Oh... Uh... yeah
[wait time="1.0"]
Townsfolk: What was all that stuff about a creator?
Townsfolk2: Uh...hm? Nothing.
Townsfolk: You wanna talk about it?
Townsfolk2: No.
[wait time="1.0"]
do Dialogic.start_timeline("check_transition_TL")
